{"id":"n69452-1-10","stage":5,"title":"우대 · 优待","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69452-1-10-1","ko":"이 식당에서 노인 우대를 한다고 들었는데요.","zh":"我听说这家餐厅有针对老年人的优惠呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당에서","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노인","meaning":"老人，老年人","explanation":"노인：老人，老年人","readings":[{"term":"노인","audio":"/audio/3b01f8c362012e852a8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63641","senseId":"1","lemma":"노인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우대를","meaning":"优待","explanation":"우대：优待；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우대","audio":"/audio/53b2a66eb097256cc6e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69452","senseId":"1","lemma":"우대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한다고","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었는데요.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"3b01f8c362012e85","term":"노인","zh":"老人，老年人","audio":"/audio/3b01f8c362012e852a8b.mp3","entryId":"63641","definition":"上岁数而年迈的人。","pronunciation":["노ː인"]},{"id":"53b2a66eb097256c","term":"우대","zh":"优待","audio":"/audio/53b2a66eb097256cc6e5.mp3","entryId":"69452","definition":"特别好地对待；或指那样的待遇。","pronunciation":["우대"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2e4b4761f6d15939ffca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69452-1-10-2","ko":"네, 저희는 육십 세 이상 노인분들을 할인된 가격으로 모시고 있습니다.","zh":"是的，我们为六十岁以上的老年人提供折扣价。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저희는","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"육십","meaning":"六十","explanation":"육십：六十","readings":[{"term":"육십","audio":"/audio/49d7d0fd17d1c247cc7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71104","senseId":"1","lemma":"육십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세","meaning":"岁","explanation":"세：岁","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64008","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이상","meaning":"以上","explanation":"이상：以上","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노인분들을","meaning":"老人，老年人；位","explanation":"노인：老人，老年人；분：位；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노인","audio":"/audio/3b01f8c362012e852a8b.mp3"},{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63641","senseId":"1","lemma":"노인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할인된","meaning":"打折，降价，优惠","explanation":"할인되다：打折，降价，优惠；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"할인되다","audio":"/audio/6fd517990b8972048520.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84574","senseId":"1","lemma":"할인되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가격으로","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모시고","meaning":"陪同，随行，请","explanation":"모시다：陪同，随行，请；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"모시다","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64703","senseId":"2","lemma":"모시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"49d7d0fd17d1c247","term":"육십","zh":"六十","audio":"/audio/49d7d0fd17d1c247cc7c.mp3","entryId":"71104","definition":"十的六倍的数目。","pronunciation":["육씹"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"64008","definition":"计算岁数的单位。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"以上","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"数量或程度好于或高于一定基准。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"3b01f8c362012e85","term":"노인","zh":"老人，老年人","audio":"/audio/3b01f8c362012e852a8b.mp3","entryId":"63641","definition":"上岁数而年迈的人。","pronunciation":["노ː인"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"6fd517990b897204","term":"할인되다","zh":"打折，降价，优惠","audio":"/audio/6fd517990b8972048520.mp3","entryId":"84574","definition":"一定数额被从定好的价格中减去。","pronunciation":["하린되다","하린뒈다"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"64829bc709a905af","term":"모시다","zh":"陪同，随行，请","audio":"/audio/64829bc709a905af727b.mp3","entryId":"64703","definition":"(尊称)带领。","pronunciation":["모ː시다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ab8806e823e5848c6ea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.561,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69452","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":4.0377,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我听说这家餐厅有针对老年人的优惠呢。","是的，我们为六十岁以上的老年人提供折扣价。","开会的时候秘书对老板低声说了什么吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我听说这家餐厅有针对老年人的优惠呢。","是的，我们为六十岁以上的老年人提供折扣价。","开会的时候秘书对老板低声说了什么吗？"],"answer":1}]}
